sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as Client (SDK/UI)
    participant API as API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Object Store<br/>9000/TCP
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Driver as Driver Pod<br/>(Argo sidecar)
    participant Launcher as Launcher Pod<br/>(Argo sidecar)
    participant MLMD as MLMD<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant SWF as SWF Controller
    participant PA as Persistence Agent

    Note over Client,MLMD: Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution

    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/runs<br/>Bearer Token / HTTP Header
    API->>DB: INSERT run record<br/>username/password
    API->>S3: Store pipeline package<br/>Access Key
    API->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Argo->>Driver: Spawn driver container
    Driver->>MLMD: Create execution context<br/>gRPC (TLS optional)
    Driver->>API: Cache lookup<br/>gRPC 8887 (TLS optional)
    Driver-->>Argo: Pod spec patches
    Argo->>Launcher: Spawn launcher container
    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>K8s Secret credentials
    Note right of Launcher: Execute user container
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>K8s Secret credentials
    Launcher->>MLMD: Publish execution results<br/>gRPC (TLS optional)

    Note over SWF,Argo: Flow 2: Scheduled Pipeline Trigger

    SWF->>SWF: Cron/periodic schedule fires
    SWF->>API: CreateRun<br/>gRPC 8887<br/>Projected SA token
    API->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over PA,DB: Flow 3: Workflow Status Sync

    PA->>Argo: Watch Workflows & SWFs<br/>K8s informers
    Argo-->>PA: Workflow status update
    PA->>API: ReportWorkflow / ReportScheduledWorkflow<br/>gRPC 8887<br/>Projected SA token
    API->>DB: UPDATE run status<br/>username/password
